将适才所言收回，而他，擅自议论摄政王，自然是不敬之罪。玑柏与众将领跪与一侧，听着李肃所答，低声骂道，他怎如此执着，此言一出，必定是人头不保。“不敬？”凤傲天薄唇微抿，凤眸微眯，本就冷漠如霜的容颜，此刻镀上一层寒光，更显得煞气逼人，“如何不敬？”即便在如此强势的逼迫下，玑柏拼尽全力控制着内心的恐惧，琢磨着此刻摄政王的心思，他们一早便知摄政王阴晴不定，但，他的心思一向喜形于色，可是，今日的他，却不同素日那般，此时，却是鬼魅难辨，更不知他如今在想些什么？玑柏内心腹诽，摄政王似乎与往日的他变得有所不同，变得让他们捉摸不透，他今日前来难道是为了兴师问罪？“末将斗胆，敢问摄政王，如今栖国兵临城下，虎视眈眈，自您亲临边关，每日除左饮酒寻欢，杀人享乐，可还记得莫不是这些戍守边关的将士誓死相博，才使得栖国不敢越界半步。如今，军心涣散，军心不稳，如何抵抗栖国的来势汹汹？难道末将所言非虚？摄政王的所作所为，与那暴君有何分别”李肃抬眸，一双漆黑的眸子怒目圆睁，厉声质问，他自知难逃一死，即便是死，他亦是要不吐不快，如今尽数说出，顿觉畅快无比，即便死后变成林中那般模样，他亦觉得值当。玑柏低垂着头，不敢窥探，心中却极为复杂，一面赞赏李肃的直言不讳，一面又觉得如此的猛将便要这般了结此生，实在凄惨，心中难掩扼腕叹息之声。凤傲天冷视着李肃，漠然冷笑，寒气冲天，转瞬便将李肃猛然升起的昂扬之气瞬息浇灭，李肃身心一震，连忙恭敬跪下，再一次道，“请摄政王赐末将死罪。”“死罪？”凤傲天启唇，扬声冷笑，“李校尉不是知晓本王的乐趣，你可知林中的景象，本王最是喜爱的紧，可惜啊，你还不配享受此等待遇。”玑柏一字不差地将凤傲天所言谨记心中，林中景象？怕是昨日刺杀摄政王之人的惨象，竟然能将李肃吓成如此这般，想来必定是惨不忍睹。四喜安然立于一侧，虽未亲眼所见，也自然能猜想到那林中的景象是何等的令人毛骨悚然，想及此，连忙躬身，干爹说过，在宫中当差，尤其是摄政王身边，必定是要谨言慎行，不得出半点差错，否则，小命不保乃是轻的，摄政王玩人的手段怕是前无古人后无来者，绝无仅有。李肃听罢，颓然心凉，不配？连那等惨绝人寰的死法都不配，那他还配何等死法？昨日，凤傲天所带亲信隐卫已被尽数诛灭，如今可用之人少之甚少，除左魂魄二人，便剩下身旁的小太监四喜，而这军营之中，她更是知之甚少，若是搁在真正的凤傲天手上，李肃所言当真不假，他若是如此荒淫无道下去，迟早亡国。不过，如今，她才是凤傲天，胆敢觊觎她的东西，她会让他们生不如死。“昨日那些被本王处置之人，他们但凡有本事与本王对抗，亦是栖国的勇士，而你，身为堂堂凤国校尉，却不战而败？本王留你何用？”凤傲天肃然而立，冷视着李肃，“既然李校尉愿大开城门，放栖国士兵**，本王便应允你如何？”李肃猛然瞪大双眸，不可置信地瞪视着凤傲天，自知适才所言，怎配成为军中统帅，连忙叩首，“末将该死。”“你等还愣着作甚，还不随李校尉一同恭迎栖国士兵入城？”凤傲天阴沉着脸，厉声喝道。“末将等誓死保卫边关！”玑柏心下更是一惊，若是城楼当真大开，他们便是凤国的罪臣，如何面对凤国百姓。“本王可不信。”凤傲天冷哼一声，转身，行至书案，翻起营中的卷宗名册，一页一页翻阅，四周寂静无声，议事厅内压抑的气息，使得众人不敢喘气。李肃更是面如死灰，顿时对自己适才口无遮拦之言后悔万分，猛然起身，抽出腰间佩刀，自刎谢罪。“哐当！”手腕一痛，佩刀落地，透着冷寒光芒。“李校尉，你不怕用你的怯懦之血玷污了此刀？”凤傲天嗤笑道，并未抬眸，修长如玉的手指翻阅着手中的卷册。李肃颓然跪与地上，想他李肃上阵杀敌无数，英勇无比，如今，却连用自己佩刀自杀都不配？他活着还有何用？“慕寒遥现在何处？”凤傲天将卷册看罢，随手合起，纤细的手指抚摸着手中的暖玉，冷声问道。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－嘿嘿，亲耐哒们，喜欢的话记得收藏哦！么么哒！编编，这一章啥都木有啊？", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/yetaicanbao/5.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Volume 1 Regency Storm 005 Suicide and Apology Inside the meeting hall, there was once again a deathly silence, and there was no sound. The soldiers guarding outside just saw a black shadow flying out of the tent. Before they could react, they saw the black shadow turning back again. They didn't know what was going on in the tent. However, when the regent entered, it would not be a happy event. I was afraid that in less than a moment, dark clouds would cover the sky and blood would fill the sky. The soldiers raised their eyes to see that such a beautiful and windy sky would soon be filled with blood. They all shook their heads and sighed. They couldn't help but take another look at the flawless blue sky. There was sadness in their determined eyes. \"Are you telling the truth just now?\" Feng Aotian stepped forward, evenly, with every step being firm and composed. When she reached where the coach was sitting, she turned around coldly. The gold-threaded auspicious clouds embroidered on the wide sleeves of her robe showed a gloomy chill as she sat down and raised her arms slightly. \"Please give the regent the death penalty!\" Li Su suddenly felt that it would be torture to live for a moment longer. The horrifying scene of the regent falling into the woods five miles away with just a flick of his hand clearly appeared in his mind. No matter how unconvinced he was, even if he fought to the death, he could not even hurt the regent's hair. Only now did he realize how ridiculous his arrogance just now was. Feng Aotian just wanted to teach him a lesson. As Ji Bai said, now is the time to employ people, and the people in this meeting hall are the pillars of the entire border military camp. Although Li Su is a reckless man, he is also a rare and strong general. He, Feng Aotian, has never done business at a loss. \"Why do you ask this king to grant you the death penalty?\" Feng Aotian sat upright with majesty, and his whole body was filled with an undoubted aura of a king. He was already a king, so how could he allow others to belittle him. \"The general should not be disrespectful to the regent.\" Li Su was stubborn by nature. Even if he was about to die, he would not take back what he just said. And for him to talk about the regent without authorization is naturally a crime of disrespect. Ji Bai and other generals knelt to one side, listened to Li Su's answer, and cursed in a low voice, \"Why is he so persistent? As soon as he said this, his life would definitely be lost.\" \"Disrespectful?\" Feng Aotian pursed her thin lips slightly and narrowed her eyes slightly. Her already cold and frosty face was now covered with a layer of cold light, making her look even more sinister. \"How can you be disrespectful?\" Even under such strong pressure, Ji Bai tried his best to control the fear in his heart. , thinking about the regent's thoughts at this moment. They knew early on that the regent was uncertain, but his mind was always happy. However, today he was different from usual. At this time, it was hard to distinguish ghosts and ghosts, and they didn't know what he was thinking about now. Ji Bai cursed in his heart. The regent seemed to be different from his past self, and he became unpredictable to them. Could it be that he came here today to raise an army to investigate? \"The general is brave enough to ask the regent. Now that Qi Kingdom's troops are approaching the city, they are watching with eager eyes. Since you came to the border in person, you have been drinking and having fun every day and killing people for pleasure. But do you still remember that it is not the soldiers guarding the border who vowed to fight each other to the death that made Qi Kingdom dare not cross the border even half a step. Now, the military morale is lax and unstable. How can we resist the menacing attack of Qi Kingdom? Is what the general said true? What is the difference between what the regent did and that tyrant?\" Li Su raised his eyes, his dark eyes widened with anger, and asked sternly. He knew that he would not escape death, and even if he died, he would not regret it. Now that he had said it all, he felt extremely relaxed. Even if he turned into what he looked like in the forest after death, he felt that it was worth it. Ji Bai lowered his head, not daring to pry, but his heart was extremely complicated. On the one hand, he appreciated Li Su's outspokenness, but on the other hand, he felt that it was really miserable for such a fierce general to end his life like this, and he couldn't hide the sound of sighing in his heart. Feng Aotian looked at Li Su coldly, sneered indifferently, and the cold air shot up to the sky. In an instant, he extinguished Li Su's sudden high spirit. Li Su was shocked physically and mentally, and quickly knelt down respectfully, and said again, \"Please give the regent the death penalty.\" \"Death penalty?\" Feng Aotian He opened his lips and sneered loudly, \"Liu Lieutenant doesn't know my pleasure. Do you know that I love the scene in the forest the most? It's a pity that you are not worthy of such treatment.\" Ji Bai kept in mind what Feng Aotian said word for word, the scene in the forest? I'm afraid that the horrific sight of the person who assassinated the regent yesterday could actually frighten Li Su to such an extent. It must have been horrific to think about. Si Xi stood peacefully on one side. Although he had not seen it with his own eyes, he could naturally guess how creepy the scene in the forest was. Thinking of this, he quickly bowed. His godfather had said that when serving in the palace, especially around the regent, one must be cautious in words and deeds and not make the slightest mistake. Otherwise, it would be too easy to risk one's life. The regent's toying with people is probably unprecedented and unique. After hearing this, Li Su felt dejected and heartbroken, not worthy? If he didn't even deserve such a tragic death, then what kind of death did he deserve? Yesterday, all the close guards led by Feng Aotian were killed, and now there are very few people available. Except for Zuo Hunsu and the other two, only the young eunuch Sixi is left beside her. And she knows very little about this military camp. If left in the hands of the real Feng Aotian, what Li Su said is true. If he continues to be so dissolute and unethical, the country will be destroyed sooner or later. However, now, she is Feng Aotian. If they dare to covet her things, she will make their lives worse than death. \"Those who were punished by this king yesterday, if they have the ability to fight against me, they are also warriors of the Qi Kingdom. And you, as a dignified captain of the Feng Kingdom, are defeated without a fight? What is the use of my king keeping you?\" Feng Aotian stood solemnly and looked at Li Su coldly, \"Since the captain Li is willing to open the city gate and release Qi, The soldiers of the country are dead, how about I agree to it?\" Li Su suddenly widened his eyes and stared at Feng Aotian in disbelief. He knew what he just said, how could he be the commander-in-chief of the army, and kowtowed quickly, \"The general deserves to die.\" \"What are you waiting for? Why don't you welcome the soldiers of the Qi Kingdom together with Lieutenant Li?", "title_en": "Chapter 5"}